WEBVTT

00:01:58.260 --> 00:02:01.720
Translation by  林运.

00:02:17.780 --> 00:02:18.520
So tired...

00:02:18.960 --> 00:02:20.800
But I can't even sleep at all...

00:02:21.520 --> 00:02:22.460
Love God...

00:02:22.920 --> 00:02:25.359
Do they really exist in this world...?

00:02:27.280 --> 00:02:28.880
I'm the Love God~

00:02:29.320 --> 00:02:30.660
Mei Tata~

00:02:31.980 --> 00:02:32.540
Youngster.

00:02:32.820 --> 00:02:33.660
No need to thank me.

00:02:34.040 --> 00:02:37.060
Enjoy your Happiness of being chased by women~

00:02:37.540 --> 00:02:39.940
Ha...ppi...ness...???

00:02:40.160 --> 00:02:41.359
HAPPINESS YOUR HEAD!

00:02:41.360 --> 00:02:43.440
MY PEACEFUL LIFE HAS BEEN RUINED!

00:02:43.860 --> 00:02:44.800
If this goes on-

00:02:44.880 --> 00:02:46.420
I might get killed!

00:02:46.420 --> 00:02:47.540
Worst come to it...

00:02:47.680 --> 00:02:48.860
I will get expelled!

00:02:50.520 --> 00:02:51.260
And finally...

00:02:51.520 --> 00:02:53.000
I will be homeless...

00:02:57.360 --> 00:02:59.800
My life is over...

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:00.880
Young Man.

00:03:00.880 --> 00:03:03.140
Don't over dramatic...

00:03:03.320 --> 00:03:04.019
Actually-

00:03:04.020 --> 00:03:05.920
It's not like this problem cannot be solved.

00:03:06.200 --> 00:03:07.560
As long as you can fulfill-

00:03:07.560 --> 00:03:08.720
their most desired wish.

00:03:08.720 --> 00:03:10.280
The magic will be lifted.

00:03:10.520 --> 00:03:11.600
And then you can be free.

00:03:12.160 --> 00:03:13.140
Just this simple!

00:03:14.220 --> 00:03:17.620
Food!! It smell soo delicious!

00:03:18.940 --> 00:03:20.020
Tch, If it's this easy...

00:03:20.180 --> 00:03:21.200
How about you do it.

00:03:27.700 --> 00:03:30.060
Wow! That idiot really jumped!

00:03:30.060 --> 00:03:30.740
Quick, go check!

00:03:30.740 --> 00:03:31.520
Gogo!

00:03:31.920 --> 00:03:33.140
He's gone!?

00:03:33.140 --> 00:03:33.640
Quick!

00:03:33.640 --> 00:03:34.339
Search over there!

00:03:37.500 --> 00:03:38.100
Haoyi!

00:03:42.380 --> 00:03:43.100
Strange...

00:03:43.340 --> 00:03:44.340
Where is Haoyi...

00:03:46.720 --> 00:03:47.720
It's YOU!

00:03:51.020 --> 00:03:51.960
Wow... that's close!

00:03:52.860 --> 00:03:54.320
Hm? I didn't see Xia Zi Tong...

00:04:02.180 --> 00:04:03.840
D-DON'T TELL ME!?

00:04:04.420 --> 00:04:08.200
Y...you unfaithful...

00:04:09.600 --> 00:04:11.019
Besides me...

00:04:11.260 --> 00:04:13.480
You have so many other women...

00:04:14.180 --> 00:04:16.560
What about me and the child...

00:04:17.760 --> 00:04:19.560
Then...

00:04:35.300 --> 00:04:36.680
Hao...yiii....

00:04:42.600 --> 00:04:43.500
Haoyi...?

00:04:44.000 --> 00:04:45.220
You're fine...

00:04:47.680 --> 00:04:48.280
T-tomorrow-

00:04:48.560 --> 00:04:50.220
C-come with me to a place...

00:04:58.720 --> 00:05:00.860
This... counts as a date... right?

00:05:04.520 --> 00:05:06.180
T-toii... letttt...

00:05:19.340 --> 00:05:21.099
Nowadays kids are really impatient-

00:05:21.100 --> 00:05:22.000
Not knowing self control.

00:05:22.000 --> 00:05:23.200
See? Caused a accident.

00:05:23.200 --> 00:05:24.300
Yeayea.

00:05:31.780 --> 00:05:33.219
As expected of Xiao Hua...

00:05:33.700 --> 00:05:35.159
Pretty and Gentle...

00:05:35.760 --> 00:05:37.440
Aiya. What am I dreaming about...

00:05:37.800 --> 00:05:38.420
Haoyi.

00:05:39.260 --> 00:05:42.360
Did you... bring me here to see the result?

00:05:43.180 --> 00:05:43.880
That's...

00:05:44.560 --> 00:05:45.420
I knew it!

00:05:45.680 --> 00:05:47.060
You're so kind~

00:05:47.600 --> 00:05:48.400
In the future-

00:05:48.400 --> 00:05:50.120
You will be a good father~

00:05:53.020 --> 00:05:53.700
Xia Zi Tong.

00:05:53.700 --> 00:05:54.960
Your report is ready.

00:05:56.380 --> 00:05:57.719
Why...

00:05:58.020 --> 00:05:59.560
But... I felt it inside...

00:05:59.560 --> 00:06:01.680
Technology for the win!!

00:06:04.560 --> 00:06:05.440
Haoyi...

00:06:05.800 --> 00:06:06.960
It's all my fault...

00:06:08.240 --> 00:06:09.200
Next time-

00:06:09.200 --> 00:06:10.979
I will do my best to get pregnant!

00:06:14.820 --> 00:06:15.440
Ah! Yes!

00:06:15.820 --> 00:06:16.599
Come.

00:06:16.600 --> 00:06:18.660
Let's go buy some things to spice it up.

00:06:19.440 --> 00:06:21.560
I'm very knowledge in this kind of stuff~

00:06:26.000 --> 00:06:26.660
Nonono!

00:06:26.660 --> 00:06:28.240
I think it will be better if I send you back home.

00:06:28.620 --> 00:06:29.500
This kind of stuff.

00:06:29.640 --> 00:06:31.340
It'll be better if I explain to your family.

00:06:41.640 --> 00:06:42.180
Haoyi.

00:06:42.460 --> 00:06:43.140
We're here.

00:06:50.120 --> 00:06:51.580
Welcome home, Miss.

00:06:53.340 --> 00:06:54.200
Wow. No way...

00:06:54.760 --> 00:06:55.560
I never knew...

00:06:55.840 --> 00:06:58.119
Xia Zi Tong was this wealthy...

00:07:01.600 --> 00:07:02.800
This kind of perfect girl...

00:07:03.340 --> 00:07:05.820
Is there anything for me to do to make her dream come truth?

00:07:07.000 --> 00:07:07.680
Haoyi.

00:07:07.840 --> 00:07:08.739
I still remember...

00:07:08.880 --> 00:07:10.940
That day you came to propose...

00:07:12.140 --> 00:07:13.020
I! Jiang Haoyi!

00:07:13.020 --> 00:07:14.580
Even though I have no house no car no job!

00:07:14.880 --> 00:07:16.100
Even if I collect garbage for a living-

00:07:16.300 --> 00:07:17.580
I can take care of her forever!

00:07:18.720 --> 00:07:21.100
Even though it's a made up, I'm still the same...

00:07:21.460 --> 00:07:25.359
Looks like... this is LIFE!

00:07:25.360 --> 00:07:28.440
Sadly... in the end you still got rejected by father...

00:07:29.120 --> 00:07:29.880
But...

00:07:30.200 --> 00:07:33.020
I'm grateful for what you're trying to do...

00:07:49.200 --> 00:07:49.740
Miss.

00:07:50.080 --> 00:07:50.960
Welcome home.

00:07:52.200 --> 00:07:53.159
Oh? This is...

00:07:54.060 --> 00:07:55.180
You don't remember?

00:07:55.180 --> 00:07:56.420
This is my boy-

00:07:57.620 --> 00:07:58.120
Boy...

00:07:58.560 --> 00:08:00.120
A rare friend...
(TL Note: 難得(Nande) 男(Nan)

00:08:00.600 --> 00:08:02.480
Ah, Please to meet you.

00:08:02.720 --> 00:08:03.800
I'm Jiang Haoyi.

00:08:10.520 --> 00:08:11.299
What?

00:08:11.780 --> 00:08:13.820
That means she's living here by herself?

00:08:15.080 --> 00:08:15.700
Yea.

00:08:15.700 --> 00:08:17.380
Ever since master's business had expended

00:08:17.380 --> 00:08:18.440
He rarely comes back home.

00:08:19.160 --> 00:08:21.260
Just by thinking about it, I feel sorry for Miss...

00:08:25.260 --> 00:08:26.719
I see...

00:08:28.460 --> 00:08:29.739
If Mr.Xia is not here...

00:08:29.740 --> 00:08:31.180
Then, I should excuse myself.

00:08:31.640 --> 00:08:32.659
Ah, Please just wait for a moment.

00:08:32.980 --> 00:08:33.900
Miss informed us.

00:08:33.900 --> 00:08:34.840
To take care of you-

00:08:36.059 --> 00:08:36.880
NOTGOODNOTGOOD!

00:08:36.880 --> 00:08:38.240
The school just called-

00:08:38.480 --> 00:08:40.000
They said, This student called Jiang Haoyi-

00:08:40.000 --> 00:08:41.500
Knocked up our Miss!

00:08:41.880 --> 00:08:43.120
Jiang Haoyi...?

00:08:43.600 --> 00:08:45.100
Where have I heard this name before...

00:08:47.860 --> 00:08:49.720
He even have to guts to come here, huh!

00:08:51.180 --> 00:08:52.060
U-uncles...

00:08:52.060 --> 00:08:53.380
T-this is a misunderstanding!

00:08:53.380 --> 00:08:55.240
I'm innocent!

00:08:56.060 --> 00:08:57.060
Innocent?!

00:08:57.060 --> 00:08:58.119
Beat him up first!

00:09:03.000 --> 00:09:04.160
STOP!

00:09:04.720 --> 00:09:08.520
ME AND HAOYI LOVES EACH OTHER!!!

00:09:15.300 --> 00:09:17.920
To think that our Miss loves this kind of guy...

00:09:18.280 --> 00:09:19.199
Such a waste!

00:09:19.460 --> 00:09:20.360
GET HIM GOOD!!!

00:09:23.640 --> 00:09:25.000
NOT MY FACE!!

00:09:31.240 --> 00:09:33.480
Even though he is poor and don't have job-

00:09:33.480 --> 00:09:35.100
And can only support me by collecting garbage.

00:09:35.560 --> 00:09:37.739
But I had already agreed to marry him!

00:09:37.920 --> 00:09:40.319
This useless trash wants to marry our Miss?!

00:09:40.400 --> 00:09:41.680
THIS TOAD WANTS TO EAT THE MEAT OF A SWAN!
(TL Note: Go google if you don't understand.)

00:09:42.020 --> 00:09:43.020
KILL HIM!

00:09:45.840 --> 00:09:46.540
Haoyi!

00:09:46.800 --> 00:09:48.719
Even though I did not get pregnant...

00:09:49.100 --> 00:09:51.140
But next time! I will do my best!

00:09:51.340 --> 00:09:53.120
Let's do our best tomorrow!

00:09:57.680 --> 00:09:59.719
I SAID STOP IT!!!

00:10:00.400 --> 00:10:00.920
You guys-

00:10:07.480 --> 00:10:08.120
Haoyi!

00:10:08.360 --> 00:10:09.120
I-

00:10:12.880 --> 00:10:13.720
Miss...

00:10:13.880 --> 00:10:15.400
Please stop talking...

00:10:15.580 --> 00:10:16.500
Quick! Come with me!

00:10:17.960 --> 00:10:19.620
WAIT! DON'T RUN!

00:10:25.100 --> 00:10:26.520
This is...

00:10:28.120 --> 00:10:29.980
Xia Zi Tong's room...

00:10:34.680 --> 00:10:36.000
MISS! OPEN THE DOOR!

00:10:36.000 --> 00:10:37.640
LET US GO IN SO WE CAN KILL THAT BASTARD!

00:10:37.640 --> 00:10:40.760
MISS! OPEN THE DOOR!

00:10:41.140 --> 00:10:41.980
NO!!

00:10:41.980 --> 00:10:43.720
MY LOVE FOR HIM IS REAL!

00:10:45.040 --> 00:10:45.680
Stop talking.

00:11:00.180 --> 00:11:00.739
ASSHOLE!

00:11:00.740 --> 00:11:02.060
WHAT ARE YOU DOING TO MISS!

00:11:11.240 --> 00:11:12.440
Last year's calendar...?

00:11:12.620 --> 00:11:13.760
Why is it still here...

00:11:15.840 --> 00:11:19.380
♥♥♥ Today I ate with father!

00:11:19.380 --> 00:11:22.060
This is the best day ever! ♥ ♥

00:11:26.480 --> 00:11:27.600
MISS! OPEN THE DOOR!

00:11:28.160 --> 00:11:29.740
DON'T GET TRICKED BY THAT KID!

00:11:29.740 --> 00:11:31.400
Master, that's the situation.

00:11:31.400 --> 00:11:32.660
As long as the Miss is alright.

00:11:32.920 --> 00:11:34.860
Anything else, I will leave it to you.

00:11:35.040 --> 00:11:36.300
Don't call me over this trivia matter.

00:11:36.580 --> 00:11:37.780
But- The Miss, she's-

00:11:39.360 --> 00:11:40.540
Haoyi...

00:11:44.080 --> 00:11:45.240
Oi! OLD MAN!

00:11:45.240 --> 00:11:47.160
I"M THE ONE THAT KNOCKED UP YOUR DAUGHTER!

00:11:47.520 --> 00:11:48.160
WHAT!

00:11:48.160 --> 00:11:49.100
IF YOU GOT THE GUTS! COME MEET ME FACE-TO-FACE!

00:11:51.080 --> 00:11:52.660
Young Man you got Guts! TT_TT

00:11:52.660 --> 00:11:53.839
Go ready the foods. TT_TT

00:11:53.840 --> 00:11:55.980
Make sure he doesn't starve while he is on his way. TT_TT

00:11:56.660 --> 00:11:58.180
No way...

00:12:02.980 --> 00:12:05.320
Checking Perimeter, Checking Perimeter.

00:12:05.320 --> 00:12:08.220
Car Units, You're Clear to Enter. Car Units, You're Clear to Enter.

00:12:09.260 --> 00:12:10.900
Wealth can only be achieved with Hard work...

00:12:11.300 --> 00:12:12.819
But that doesn't mean it won't had it's own downfall...

00:12:13.960 --> 00:12:14.460
Note: I really have no idea what those two lines mean. So I just put in what I think it means.

00:12:27.780 --> 00:12:29.560
Welcome Home, Master!

00:12:33.040 --> 00:12:41.000
Translated by 林运.

00:12:50.080 --> 00:12:55.960
Edited by 林运.

00:13:08.000 --> 00:13:12.820
Timing by 林运.

00:13:16.720 --> 00:13:21.720
Hope you guys enjoyed this one, I will not do another episode because I am lazy.

